Z||000000||Galen||07-29-2001||06:11 AM||||this could be posted in general, but it deals with other car forums so it'll be fine here.<P>Over on that 'mr2 board' most mr2 owners will bash fieros any chance they get. Unknowingly cuasing themselves to look stupid in the eyes of anyone who knows about cars & fiero's. This, however annoying, is something we can overlook due to some 'cool' mr2 owners, some of which are members of this forum as well. Any chance I get, I do not bash mr2s.<P>I've noticed somewhat less bashing on thirdgen.org, when I search around for fiero related materal. Its like a 50/50 split with them. Some like em, some dont. Some praise em. Some dont. but for the most part, general bashing is not a normal thing. I do not bash fbodies, I happen to like most. <P>On this forum, we seem to bash not just one particular type of car. We seem to dislike a whole 'genre of car' if you can call them that. 'ricers' as it has been said. However, we do not bash mr2s or fbodies any chance we get. Another However, we do have some 'less intelligent' people who seem to get off on the fact that they can bash other peoples cars and get a response to it. I have been known to be guilty of this in the past as well. <P>In my own personal opinion, I believe that this forum, as a total, does not focus in on one certain car. We do however, seem to focus in on certain people to bash. This unsettles me a little bit. While in the eyes of others we are but a strange folk, we have decided in our own eyes that we will be friendly, helpful and unwilling to fal to level of others as a group. <P>Atleast thats how it used to be. I find here lately, around the last 3-4 months that we have gotten to the point where we are <B>NOT</B> friendly, <B>NOT</B> helpful, and plenty willing to fall to the levels of other 'not so intelligent' car owners. <P>If someone says my car is a ugly, slow POS. Is this going to affect me? Of course it is, I have put alot of work and time into that car, it is not finished by a long shot, but I do not believe it to be ugly. But other than a little bit of hurt pride and maybe a little bit of displeasure for the person who said it. How will doing anything back help me? If I do nothing: will the world will continue to turn, Yes. Will my car crank in the morning, Hopefully <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. Will I still go to sleep at 7 in the morning, defintly. And if I do anything, what will that do? Other than getting myself a little riled up over trivial things, and maybe pissing someone off. Nothing.<P>Summing things up, Pennock's Fiero Forum has a wonderful wealth of knowledge. As well it has very friendly people who are pretty much open minded. Since I first joined this place back in 99, I've seen people come and go. I've seen some come, cause a fuss and then leave. The amount of knowledge has never swayed, only grown. The friendly people are still here. And this place only grows in its greatness. And my enjoyment grows everyday.<P>My7Fieros, TheOgre, MonkeyMan, Stimpy, AusFiero, FieroLisa, Pontiaddict, Standard, DarkLord, Orief, Songman, and many others I can't remember at 6am in the morning. But Specially Cliff... I'd like to say thank you for nearly two years of enjoyment, laughter, a lil pain, annoyances, and everything else. <P>Thank You<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="purple">Ray</FONT> <FONT COLOR="gray">-</FONT> <FONT COLOR="purple">"And God said there shall be one in thy owns image, and he made me"</FONT><BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ray19nc/download.html" TARGET=_blank>Download FieroProject.com Chat Client v1.50 Today</A>||||reg||1
