Z||000009||frontal lobe||07-30-2001||02:58 AM||||Well, I've always thought Fiero owners had some characteristics in common that caused them to own a Fiero in the first place--open minded enough to see the value, independent thinking enough to not care that much what others thought, more appreciative than average of cars in general.  And since we get maligned a fair amount for the car we own, we are a little more sensitive not to bash others cars, just because they may have a different taste than we do.<P>So for all those on the forum who are willing to dislike someone else's car without getting personal and ripping on them, I salute you.||||reg||1
